-The smoke test must report PASS for:
-
-- `FindPlayerByID` on the dedicated player;
-- `cascadeProfile` write/read round-trip, followed by restoration of the original player state;
-- `FetchUniqueValues` returning the expected `ownerId`;
-- a second `CreateUniqueValue` for the same `ownerId + tag` being rejected without replacing/duplicating the first value;
-- `cascadeStandard` publish/admin-read;
-- `cascadeDaily` publish/admin-read;
-- `cascadeDailyStreak` publish/admin-read;
-- `cascadeMastery` publish/admin-read;
-- leaderboard rows exposing the same name/avatar stored on the GamePush player.
-
